    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data, we utilize encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. we key management is handled through EU-based infrastructure, ensuring that sensitive data is protected. we also implement strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT), we are familiar with the framework and ensure that we solutions do not undermine a firm's reporting obligations. we experience in working with clients bound by professional secrecy, including national professional orders, further demonstrates we ability to handle sensitive information while maintaining compliance with such regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To maintain separation of duties and auditor's independence, we segregate duties between development and production operations. segregate ensures that no single individual has control over all aspects of the system, reducing the risk of data breaches or unauthorized modifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Compliance with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents is also ensured through we configurable retention policies, which are aligned with legal archival obligations. we maintain audit logging of access and every system output, providing a clear trail of activities performed on client data. we Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointment and maintenance of a data processing register further demonstrate we commitment to GDPR compliance and personal data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The availability of a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) aligned with GDPR Article 28 ensures that we can establish a contractual basis for the processing of personal data on behalf of clients." ;
