        ex:hasText "Regulatory, professional and legal constraints  4.1 Professional secrecy and confidentiality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA will utilize Our company, Faber IA Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities, which generate answers from passages retrieved from a controlled corpus and cite passages retrieved from a controlled corpus." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach ensures that answers are grounded in validated material, such as accounting standards, tax doctrine, and commercial code, thus preserving professional secrecy and reliability of figures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide retrieval of regulatory and methodological information, assistance in drafting professional documents, support in handling client files, and support for the continuity of missions between collaborators, Our company, Faber IA can leverage Our company, Faber IA capabilities in hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting. hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting will enable the AI component to provide accurate and reliable information while maintaining explainability and traceability of outputs. our Atelier platform is designed to support iterative methodologies, including corpus curation with experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and evaluation loops. designed ensures that the AI component is tailored to the specific needs of Cabinet Vauclair Associés and provides high-quality outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability, reliability, and traceability of outputs, Our company, Faber IA will implement features such as source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval traces, and logging of every interaction for posterior audit." ;
