    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, how can our company's ensure a coherent tender response that addresses all these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure a coherent tender response, I will address each requirement based on our company's company context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, improving information access and centralizing data storage can be achieved through our company's flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organization's own documents. forges aligns with the client's need for reliable and up-to-date information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the requirement that no decision or sign off may be automated, our company's our flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organization's own documents solution is designed as a non-decisional assistance tool, ensuring that professional secrecy and reliability of figures are preserved. designed is in line with our company's past references, such as the national professional order and regional hospital group, where our company's delivered solutions that respected confidentiality and sensitivity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Facilitating collaboration and mission continuity can be supported through our flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organization's own documents ability to provide access to information and assist professionals in professionals daily activities. our flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organization's own documents partnership with Ligeo Conseil, an integration partner, will also enable seamless integration with the client's existing production tools, such as accounting production software and document management." ;
