        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of providing solutions that fit into existing practices, our company's hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure allows our company's to adapt to the client's needs and ensure a smooth integration with the client's current workflows. our company's framing phase, in particular, pays attention to confidentiality, existing production tools, and seasonality of workload, which is crucial for a regional accounting and statutory audit firm like Cabinet Vauclair Associés." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the pilot phase deadline of the tax filing deadline, our company's will leverage our company's confirmed availability to onboard an engagement of this size within the proposed timeline. our company's project management methodology, including joint steering and operational committees, RACI matrix, and escalation path, ensures that our company's can deliver a coherent and effective solution that meets all the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By emphasizing our company's ability to deliver a tailored solution that respects the client's existing practices, regulatory constraints, and budgetary limitations, while also highlighting our company's past experiences and partnerships, our company's can ensure a strong tender response that addresses all the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message4> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands a system with response times below 2 seconds for common queries, high availability during business hours, integration with The client existing information systems and user directories, hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU, and no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
